{
  "book_id": "RiskManagement",
  "book_title": "Risk Management Handbook",
  "pdf_path": "resources/library/RiskManagement/RiskManagement.pdf",
  "section": {
    "type": "chapter",
    "title": "Chapter 5",
    "start_page": 39,
    "end_page": 43,
    "pages": [
      {
        "page_number": 39,
        "elements": []
      },
      {
        "page_number": 40,
        "elements": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12148",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              48.01917266845703,
              79.0199966430664,
              57.01917266845703
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Flight in the proximity of some environmental hazards may lead to serious or catastrophic accidents. Avoidance strategies ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              58.087425231933594,
              560.5130615234375,
              68.0874252319336
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "reduce the risk by lowering the accident likelihood. This requires pilots to plan, exercise patience, remain flexible, and be ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              69.0874252319336,
              560.4981689453125,
              79.0874252319336
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "creative.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              80.0874252319336,
              88.15000915527344,
              90.0874252319336
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Circumnavigate the Hazard",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              104.00556182861328,
              182.91998291015625,
              114.00556182861328
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12149",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              115.31916046142578,
              79.0199966430664,
              124.31916046142578
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "For some hazards, such as convective activity and very high terrain, a possible mitigation may be a plan to circumnavigate the ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              125.38741302490234,
              560.5155639648438,
              135.38742065429688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "hazard.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              136.38742065429688,
              83.15000915527344,
              146.38742065429688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Go Above or Below the Hazard",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              160.30555725097656,
              199.7639923095703,
              170.30555725097656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12151",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              171.6192169189453,
              79.0199966430664,
              180.6192169189453
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sometimes a plan to fly at a different altitude reduces accident likelihood. Pilots can plan for altitudes that keep the aircraft ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              181.68746948242188,
              560.5131225585938,
              191.68746948242188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "above or below icing conditions. Many instrument pilots who operate aircraft that are not approved for flight in known icing ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              192.68746948242188,
              560.48681640625,
              202.68746948242188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "conditions apply personal minimums to avoid conditions below certain temperatures or where the freezing level is at or below ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              203.68746948242188,
              560.5040893554688,
              213.68746948242188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "the minimum en-route altitude.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              214.68746948242188,
              178.44000244140625,
              224.68746948242188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Change Departure Time or Date",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              238.60560607910156,
              203.85098266601562,
              248.60560607910156
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12152",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              249.91920471191406,
              79.0199966430664,
              258.919189453125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Advancing or delaying a departure may reduce risk likelihood. For example, on a day when a line of afternoon thunderstorms ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              259.9874572753906,
              560.5401000976562,
              269.9874572753906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "is forecast, a pilot could plan for an early morning departure or wait until the thunderstorms dissipate and depart late in the ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              270.9874572753906,
              560.526123046875,
              280.9874572753906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "afternoon. For some meteorological hazards, such as an incoming low-pressure system, the pilot might choose to depart the day ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              281.9874572753906,
              560.5252075195312,
              291.9874572753906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "before originally planned.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              292.9874572753906,
              157.5900115966797,
              302.9874572753906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cancel the Flight",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              316.90557861328125,
              134.5699920654297,
              326.90557861328125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12153",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              328.21917724609375,
              79.0199966430664,
              337.21917724609375
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Canceling a flight is necessary if the pilot cannot mitigate risk sufficiently by other means.  The cancellation option is easier if ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              338.2874450683594,
              560.53125,
              348.2874450683594
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "another means of transportation is available or if long-term rescheduling is an option.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              349.2874450683594,
              395.34002685546875,
              359.2874450683594
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Mitigating External Pressure Risks",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldMT",
            "font_size": 11.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              373.3965759277344,
              234.94998168945312,
              384.3965759277344
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12154",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              385.5191650390625,
              79.0199966430664,
              394.5191650390625
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "External pressures can be either subtle or overt. Because it may involve passengers or others waiting for the arrival, it is best to ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              395.5874328613281,
              560.5241088867188,
              405.5874328613281
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "inform them of the need for flexibility.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              406.5874328613281,
              208.5850067138672,
              416.5874328613281
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Local Versus Transportation Flights",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              430.50555419921875,
              224.59597778320312,
              440.50555419921875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12155",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              441.8191833496094,
              79.0199966430664,
              450.8191833496094
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A local pleasure flight can still be subject to external pressures, but it is easier to cancel than a scheduled flight related to ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              451.887451171875,
              560.5010986328125,
              461.887451171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "transportation to an event. When planning a local flight with friends, for example, the pilot can reduce external pressures ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              462.887451171875,
              560.5018920898438,
              472.887451171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "by telling them in advance that the flight could be canceled at the last minute due to weather or other reasons. For an IFR ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              473.887451171875,
              560.4984741210938,
              483.887451171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "transportation flight, persons meeting the flight can use an application to know if the flight will arrive as planned. For a VFR ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              484.887451171875,
              560.496826171875,
              494.887451171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "flight anyone meeting the flight may wait at home and get notified after the flight arrives.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              495.887451171875,
              411.7299499511719,
              505.887451171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Personal Versus Business Flights",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              519.8055419921875,
              214.7979736328125,
              529.8055419921875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12156",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              531.1192016601562,
              79.0199966430664,
              540.1192016601562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pilots who fly business associates may feel significant external pressures. The pilot should manage passenger expectations and ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              541.1874389648438,
              560.51416015625,
              551.1874389648438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "may plan for alternative travel options as a means to reduce risk.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              552.1874389648438,
              312.280029296875,
              562.1874389648438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Case Study",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldMT",
            "font_size": 11.0,
            "color": "#AA1E22",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              580.7965698242188,
              113.90599060058594,
              591.7965698242188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12157",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              592.919189453125,
              79.0199966430664,
              601.919189453125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Note: Refer to the case study supporting data in Chapter 3, Identifying Hazards and Associated Risks, and the risk assessment ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              602.9874267578125,
              560.506103515625,
              612.9874267578125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "matrix in Chapter 4, Assessing Risk, to continue the risk mitigation phase of the case study.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              613.9874267578125,
              419.4100646972656,
              623.9874267578125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Risk Mitigation Analysis",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldMT",
            "font_size": 11.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              638.0965576171875,
              180.11607360839844,
              649.0965576171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12158",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              650.2191772460938,
              79.0199966430664,
              659.2191772460938
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tricia diligently identified the hazards and assessed the risks of her proposed flight from Durango, CO to Santa Rosa, CA. She ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              660.2874145507812,
              560.5260009765625,
              670.2874145507812
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "should now mitigate the high and serious risks that she identified during the assessment phase. She identified four high and five ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              671.2874145507812,
              560.4671020507812,
              681.2874145507812
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "serious risks that she should attempt to mitigate by reducing risk likelihood, severity, or both.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              682.2874145507812,
              426.906982421875,
              692.2874145507812
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "12159",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              694.0191650390625,
              79.0199966430664,
              703.0191650390625
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tricia starts by reconsidering the overall plan for this flight. She rules out making a non-stop flight because carrying the Smiths ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              704.08740234375,
              560.527099609375,
              714.08740234375
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "and their baggage would require a reduced fuel load, which in this case is a serious (yellow) risk. In addition, the direct route ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              715.08740234375,
              560.5103149414062,
              725.08740234375
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "could lead to encounters with thunderstorms, icing conditions, areas of low ceilings, and high terrain. Furthermore, she realizes ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              726.08740234375,
              560.5107421875,
              736.08740234375
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "they should leave Monday morning, rather than Tuesday, because of the incoming front and low-pressure area. She also notes ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              737.08740234375,
              560.5140991210938,
              747.08740234375
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
